abstract: "A draft Grants Charter and machine-readable decision-record profile for reconstructable ENS grant and service-provider decisions, with Phase II evaluator-manifest commitment, schema 0.2 extensions, deterministic public projection, and a retrospective empirical corpus. Package version 0.4.0 is an engineering checkpoint; it does not claim ENS endorsement or a completed v1.0.0 assurance boundary."
